格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 插件：DeepSeek 官方 API 余额与当前会话费用估算","id":"gh:1333737883","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"deepseek-billing-plugin","slug":"xinCodes/deepseek-billing-plugin","topics":["billing","deepseek","deepseek-billing","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 插件：DeepSeek 官方 API 余额与当前会话费用估算"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# deepseek-billing-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness（DSH）工作台插件：用你的 DeepSeek 官方 API Key 实时查看**账户余额**和**当前会话花费**。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **顶部标题栏**：余额按钮（`CNY ¥19.16`），弹层含总余额 / 赠送 / 充值明细，60 秒自动刷新。\n- **底部统计条**：本会话费用以 `会话 ¥0.0042` 融合进系统自带的"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" composer 统计条同一行，悬停显示明细（模型 / 未命中 / 命中 / 输出 / 合计 / 计费时段）。费用按官方价格页快照计算（含 2026-08-17 峰谷调价，按北京时间峰谷时段自动选价"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"），是**估算值**，token 数来自 DSH 的 `tokenUsage` 会话投影（provider 报告的真实值）。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 仓库结构"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"预构建产物（`lib/`）已提交，**开箱即用，无需编译**。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 方式一：装进 profile（推荐，无需改源码）"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. 克隆本仓库："},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"2. 初始化（或复用）一个 profile，并把**两个包**以 `file:` 依赖挂进去（`<repo>` 指代本仓库路径）："},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"其中 `packages/deepseek-billing` 声明了 `dsh.bundle`（patch 清单），bundle 机制会把补丁里两行插件（宿主 + 客户端）挂进组合树，无需 `--pa"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"tch`；客户端包需一并安装（它是补丁引用的包名）。\n3. 启动："},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"4. 打开 http://127.0.0.1:3080 ，标题栏出现余额按钮；若打了解锁补丁（下节），底部统计条出现会话费用。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 方式二：在你的 deepseek-harness 源码检出内安装（开发者）"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"1. 把 `packages/deepseek-billing` 拷到检出根 `packages/billing/deepseek-billing`，把 `packages/ui-deepseek-b"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"illing` 拷到 `packages/client/ui-deepseek-billing`。\n2. `packages/bundle/web-app/package.json` 的 depend"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"encies 加 `\"@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-billing\": \"workspace:^\"`（客户端包已在其内则跳过）。\n3. `pnpm install` 后，用 bu"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"\"@deepseek-ai/dsh-deepseek-billing\": \"workspace:^\"`（客户端包已在其内则跳过）。\n3. `pnpm install` 后，用 bundle 补丁启动："},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## API Key"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"余额接口需要你的 DeepSeek 官方 API Key（open platform 的 `sk-` key）。插件按以下顺序解析，密钥只发往 `api.deepseek.com`："},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1. bundle 补丁里的插件配置字面量 `apiKey`\n2. DSH 的 credentials 域（Web 设置页\"模型\"里填过的 `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`）\n3. 启动环境变量 "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"字面量 `apiKey`\n2. DSH 的 credentials 域（Web 设置页\"模型\"里填过的 `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`）\n3. 启动环境变量 `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"覆盖示例（编辑 `packages/deepseek-billing/cordis.patch.yml`）："},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## \"统计条融合\"的解锁补丁"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"费用融合依赖 DSH 客户端新增的一个子槽 `conversation.composer.stats.extra`。**未打补丁也能用**（余额功能完整），只是会话费用不显示。要解锁："},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"补丁内容（`StatsLine` 及其 slot 声明共 ~15 行）：给统计条条目声明一个 list 子槽，并在统计行里渲染它，费用组件借此把 `会话 ¥…` 插进同一行。"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 价格表"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"`packages/ui-deepseek-billing/src/pricing.ts` 的 `DEFAULT_PRICE_TABLE`：按生效时间的多档价目（2026-08-17 起峰谷定价已建模"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"）。官方调价时改这里即可；改动后重新 `pnpm build`（或只用检出内构建）。"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## 安全与隐私"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"- API Key 只发送到 `api.deepseek.com`（余额接口），不落日志、不进前端界面。\n- 无任何数据上报；余额/费用全部在本机计算与展示。\n- 费用为估算，以官方扣费为准。"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"A plugin for the DeepSeek Harness web workbench that shows your DeepSeek account balance (top sessio"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"n header) and the current session's estimated cost (fused into the built-in composer stats strip, li"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"ve from the `tokenUsage` session projection). Cost pricing snapshots the official pricing page, incl"},{"id":"p37s4","text":"uding the 2026-08-17 Beijing peak/off-peak tiers; it is an estimate. Installation: clone, add both p"},{"id":"p37s5","text":"ackages to a DSH profile as `file:` dependencies (the `deepseek-billing` package is a `dsh.bundle`, "},{"id":"p37s6","text":"so its patch mounts both halves automatically), then `dsh --profile <name> web`. To enable the stats"},{"id":"p37s7","text":"-strip fusion, apply `patches/001-composer-stats-extra.patch` to your harness checkout and rebuild t"},{"id":"p37s8","text":"he conversation client bundle. The API key is read from plugin config → credentials domain → `DEEPSE"},{"id":"p37s9","text":"EK_API_KEY` env, and is sent only to `api.deepseek.com`."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
